  <identification><creator type="composer">Traditional German carol tune (early 19th century)</creator><rights>Public domain tune (early 19th-century folk melody, words not included). Keyfall arrangement: transposed from E-flat to C, 6/8, fingering and left hand are original. Melody cross-checked against, and where my memory was not exact read from, Wikimedia Commons File:Süßer die Glocken nie klingen.mid (CC0, Rabanus Flavus). Nothing of its harmony or layout used.</rights></identification>
